  "synopsis": {
    "zh": "令史史呵誓常誦安樂行相關經文，以悲忍為懷，在往返京省中持誦。難句保留未解；臨終與舌相按原書轉述。",
    "en": "A clerk named Shi Heshi kept compassion and patience in mind while reciting alongside his duties. A difficult phrase remains unresolved; signs at death are attributed to the source."
  },
